  "bodyHash": "0b81f4ca1ce9d272",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛意打造。大量活躍於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Silkier Touch 擴充了精準採集附魔的功能。各項功能均可在配置檔案中切換開關。您將能夠拾取如刷怪籠、龍蛋、蛋糕（未被食用過）、受感染石塊等物品的原版掉落物！<br><br>請參閱下方設定檔以查看完整功能列表。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"前置需求\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"支援配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDragonEggDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">使用精準採集鎬子時，停用龍蛋的傳送功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSpawnerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用怪物刷怪籠的精準採集掉落。保留生物資料。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrialSpawnerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">降低試煉刷怪籠的「強度」以允許破壞它。將使用精準採集鎬子時掉落。更改此設定需要重新啟動遊戲。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFullCakeDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許未被食用過的蛋糕透過精準採集掉落。同樣適用於插有蠟燭的蛋糕。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableBuddedAmethystDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集挖掘時掉落簇狀紫水晶。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFarmlandDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集收割時掉落耕地。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTallGrassDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集收割時掉落高草。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSnowLayerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集收割時掉落雪層。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableVinesDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集收割時掉落藤蔓。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableInfestedStoneDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許使用精準採集挖掘時掉落受感染石塊。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">全部皆使用精準採集附魔挖掘：<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>怪物刷怪籠：</strong><br><em>試煉刷怪籠預設為停用：</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蛋糕（有無蠟燭皆可）與雪層：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>龍蛋不會傳送：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
